    "description": {
      "value": "<p>After adding the hair, nail clipping, or other part of a human, drinking this potion perfectly transforms you into that human for 1 hour, changing your height, weight, facial features, sound of your voice, hair length and coloration. None of your statistics change, but your size may change to match the targeted human.</p>\n<p>The potion works for part-humans, but not half-humans. The consistency of the potion is always like a thick mud, but the color and flavor change based on the targeted human, typically tasting very unpleasant.</p>",
